MPQE v2.0 by WRS / Ascent maintainers

MPQE now builds as a native StormLib-backed extractor and no longer depends on ShadowFlare's `SFmpq.dll`.

For usage instructions, run `MPQE.exe` with no options or arguments.

Notable additions in this tree:
- deterministic patch ordering
- TBC archive stack mode from a WoW client or Data directory
- DBC-only extraction mode that strips `DBFilesClient\\` into a server-ready `DBC\\` output tree
- native Visual Studio solution/project with no runtime MPQ DLL dependency

Examples:
- `MPQE.exe /tbc /p "D:\\WoW243\\Data"`
- `MPQE.exe /dbc /locale enGB "D:\\WoW243"`
- `MPQE.exe /dbc /locale enGB /d "D:\\Extracted\\DBC" "D:\\WoW243"`

Ascent - http://www.ascentemu.com/
StormLib - https://github.com/ladislav-zezula/StormLib
